        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6450 Ribbon and Reed Oval Edinburgh Entrance Trim Set with Matching 5031 Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>Made popular in Colonial France, the Ribbon and Reed design will add a level of old world charm and sophistication to almost any space. The Baldwin made 6450 Edinburgh Tubular Entrance Trim Set is crafted out of solid brass and comes backed with a limited lifetime mechanical warranty, insuring that it lives up to the high standards expected of Baldwin. This oval entry set comes paired with the matching 5031 knob for an outstandingly beautiful, classic look. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\" for a door thickness of 1-3/4\". Available with either a single cylinder or a full dummy set function.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This Baldwin Tubular Entrance Trim Set is designed for easy installation for standard pre-drilled wood or metal doors. It is fully reversible to accommodate all door conditions. Forged out of solid brass, it is built to last and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty to assure that it meets the Baldwin standards of excellence.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/oval-ribbon-and-reed-knobset-baldwin-5031\"><b>Matching Oval Ribbon and Reed Knobset</b></a>\r\nand <a href=\"/\"><b>Oval Edinburgh Handleset</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 6450 Oval Edinburgh Traditional Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Certified by Underwriters Laboratories (UL) for use on fire doors up to three-hour rating.</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt and latch case are formed out of steel for strength.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced steel security strike with three inch screws.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Limited Warranty</b> on workmanship, materials, operation and PVD (003) polished brass finish.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Tubular Oval Edinburgh Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Interior Trim: 5031 Knob</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 10.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2.74\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2.74\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Length: 2.70\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Width: 1.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing:  5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-6450.pdf?v=1691094971\" target=\"new\"><b>Oval Edinburgh Entrance Trim Specification Sheet (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the entrance set latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the knob operates the latch as well as the deadbolt for immediate egress.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-2-Functions-entryset.jpg?v=1704354585\" width=\"250\" height=\"100\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Functions Chart\"></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Oval Edinburgh Entrance Trim Set, Baldwin 6450",
                "description": "Baldwin 6450 Oval Edinburgh Entrance Trim - Made popular in Colonial France, the Ribbon and Reed design will add a level of old world charm and sophistication to almost any space. The Baldwin made 6450 Edinburgh Tubular Entrance Trim Set is crafted out of solid brass and comes backed with a limited lifetime mechanical warranty, insuring that it lives up to the high standards expected of Baldwin. This oval entry set comes paired with the matching 5031 knob for an outstandingly beautiful, classic look. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/4 inches or 2-3/8 inches for a door thickness of 1-3/4 inches. Available with either a single cylinder or a full dummy set function.",
